Read [VISION.md](VISION.md), [GLOSSARY.md](GLOSSARY.md) and [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md) before changing behaviour or boundaries.
Use `npm run check`; acceptance cases and required evidence live in DESIGN.md and tests/journey.test.mjs.
